### VULN-018 — Unauthenticated session via anonymous() plugin
### Not covered by signupGuard (which only wraps /api/auth/sign-up/*).
POST http://localhost:21527/api/auth/sign-in/anonymous HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
Origin: http://localhost:21526
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Response sets Cookie: classroomio.session_token=... for a user with isAnonymous=true.
### That cookie then satisfies authMiddleware / authOrApiKeyMiddleware on protected routes
### (e.g. GET /account/profile, GET /organization) that return 401 without it.
